for strength or yoga

01:56:21.680 --> 01:56:23.940
or other things that you
might be doing like work

01:56:23.940 --> 01:56:26.450
and other things, unrelated to exercise.

01:56:26.450 --> 01:56:30.620
Since that's a vast space
