01:57:08.470 --> 01:57:10.770
and how one can use concurrent training,

01:57:10.770 --> 01:57:12.130
meaning training for endurance,

01:57:12.130 --> 01:57:13.030
training for strength,

01:57:13.030 --> 01:57:14.220
training for hypertrophy,

01:57:14.220 --> 01:57:15.490
training for all these different things

01:57:15.490 --> 01:57:17.270
