02:01:24.770 --> 02:01:27.250
That's also of the sort
that we call long duration

02:01:27.250 --> 02:01:28.450
endurance work.

02:01:28.450 --> 02:01:29.970
High intensity training we'll tap

02:01:29.970 --> 02:01:32.990
